WEBVTT

00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:01.600
An uploaded image

00:00:01.411 --> 00:00:02.213
can take over

00:00:02.025 --> 00:00:02.755
the server

00:00:03.294 --> 00:00:04.768
Upload2Shell is a

00:00:04.579 --> 00:00:06.419
use-after-free in Ghostscript's

00:00:06.230 --> 00:00:07.220
Type 1 font

00:00:07.032 --> 00:00:08.199
loader that escapes

00:00:08.011 --> 00:00:09.343
its safer sandbox

00:00:09.155 --> 00:00:10.334
and runs attacker

00:00:10.145 --> 00:00:10.959
commands

00:00:11.098 --> 00:00:12.677
Ghostscript sits underneath

00:00:12.489 --> 00:00:13.031
print

00:00:13.279 --> 00:00:13.986
email

00:00:14.093 --> 00:00:15.425
upload and preview

00:00:15.237 --> 00:00:16.085
workflows

00:00:16.606 --> 00:00:18.256
Files named png

00:00:18.068 --> 00:00:19.436
or jpg can

00:00:19.247 --> 00:00:20.603
still reach Ghostscript

00:00:20.415 --> 00:00:21.723
through image conversion

00:00:21.863 --> 00:00:23.218
Researchers confirmed

00:00:23.030 --> 00:00:24.209
routes in Google's

00:00:24.021 --> 00:00:25.129
document renderer

00:00:25.188 --> 00:00:25.966
WordPress

00:00:26.037 --> 00:00:26.992
Debian CUPS

00:00:27.063 --> 00:00:27.806
Roundcube

00:00:27.924 --> 00:00:29.763
DokuWiki and MediaWiki

00:00:30.302 --> 00:00:32.094
Found on July 27

00:00:31.988 --> 00:00:32.790
it was fixed

00:00:32.602 --> 00:00:35.773
in Ghostscript 10.08.0

00:00:35.585 --> 00:00:36.894
on September 8

00:00:37.033 --> 00:00:38.282
Update Ghostscript

00:00:38.094 --> 00:00:39.261
wherever documents

00:00:39.073 --> 00:00:39.886
get rendered

00:00:40.422 --> 00:00:41.436
Full story on

00:00:41.247 --> 00:00:42.143
the dashboard
